### Topic 55 - WebFlux sample requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension)
@base = http://localhost:8080

### 1. All products (Flux<Product> -> JSON array)
GET {{base}}/api/products

### 2. One product (Mono<Product>)
GET {{base}}/api/products/1

### 3. Missing product -> 404
GET {{base}}/api/products/999

### 4. Products by category
GET {{base}}/api/products/category/electronics

### 5. Create a product
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keyboard",
  "category": "electronics",
  "price": 25.00
}

### 6. Delete a product
DELETE {{base}}/api/products/2

### 7. Server-Sent Events: live price ticker (one event per second, 10 events)
GET {{base}}/api/stream/prices
Accept: text/event-stream

### 8. Functional route
GET {{base}}/fn/hello?name=Asha

### 9. Functional route returning products
GET {{base}}/fn/products

### 10. WebClient demo: this endpoint calls /api/products using WebClient
GET {{base}}/api/client/summary

### 11. zip demo: product + stock "in parallel"
GET {{base}}/api/products/1/details
